Well, another tourny, another chance to slaughter all that lives (and
some that doesn't!). I tried to avoid genociding, I wanted to kill as
much as possible. However, I eventually broke down and genocided mind
flayers. After about 40 megatonnes of my gray matter being tentacled
out my ears, I'd had enough! And then I genocided vampire bats so I
could get more Xorns on my quest level to send to Anhur (in exchange
for spellbooks and protection). Anhurs a twitchy guy, you rack up 15 or
20 points of protection, and then accidently sacrifice one measly
little black unicorn, and you're back to square one!

An dungeon sure gets lonely after a while... With only the gentle
lapping of Rodneys attacks to keep me from going crazy. (You really
don't worry about much when you've got 6100 hp! Except for maybe green
slimes.. damn green slimes..)

I'm going to go rest my "nethack claw" until next year. And no more of
this talk about scores not mattering. ;)


